Description: Tharsis 4k Intro/2004/Linux
 4k intro by Tharsis of Bliss, released in 2004 for the #demoscene 4k
 source compo, where it ranked 2nd in the pc 4k competition.
 .
 OpenGL effects on a yellow background in a 640x480 window: rotating
 ellipses, a spiral of quads, growing red strips and clouds of black
 cubes, with a Hammond organ tune synthesized in real time, in less than
 4 KB of C source. Press any key to quit.
